{"id":"higurumaretrial","lines":[{"t":0,"end":8.16,"chars":[0],"who":"Random Judge","text":"If there are any objections to today's trial, submit your final appeal in writing within 15 days, which includes today.","de":"Falls es Einwände gegen die heutige Verhandlung gibt: reicht eure letzte Berufung innerhalb von 15 Tagen schriftlich ein — heute mitgerechnet.","orig":"scenes/higurumaretrial/lines/01.mp3"},{"t":11.2,"end":12.85,"chars":[1],"who":"Higuruma","text":"*annoyed breath in*","de":"*verärgerter Atemzug*","orig":"scenes/higurumaretrial/lines/02.mp3"},{"t":19.42,"end":21.03,"chars":[2],"who":"Shimizu","text":"Higuruma... what are you doing?","de":"Higuruma… was machst du da?","orig":"scenes/higurumaretrial/lines/03.mp3"},{"t":24.55,"end":26.47,"chars":[1],"who":"Higuruma","text":"Everyone come back...","de":"Alle kommt zurück…","orig":"scenes/higurumaretrial/lines/04.mp3"},{"t":31.37,"end":33.28,"chars":[1],"who":"Higuruma","text":"We're having a retrial.","de":"Wir machen eine Neuverhandlung.","orig":"scenes/higurumaretrial/lines/05.mp3"}]}